   Rxvt-1.5 was OK at scrolling plain text (15% slower than xterm), 
   but was really bad when control or escape codes were embedded
   in the text (man pages, 4x as slow as xterm).
   Rxvt-1.6 is now FASTER than xterm in all tests that I did,
   by 50 to 100 %.
2. rclock now checks mail correctly

BUGS:
1. Scrolling with large chunks of selected (cut&paste) text on
   the screen is unpleasant, because it flickers. 
2. Due to the nature of the changes, I recommend retaining your
   old binaries until you try out the new ones, and make sure that
   they work

