          # *     dfaxlow  DigiFAX low (normal) resolution
          #       djet500  H-P DeskJet 500
          # *     djet500c  H-P DeskJet 500C
          #       epson   Epson-compatible dot matrix printers (9- or 24-pin)
          # +     eps9high  Epson-compatible 9-pin, interleaved lines
