[archie: a system that will let you check a database for available FTP 
sites around the world for specific files.]

I am sorry to update so soon but I have been informed that a patch for 
archie 1.4.1 which I was unaware of at the time is needed in order to 
"talk" to the version 3 archie servers.  Although the former might do 
the job for you, you are encouraged to upgrade since it might cause load 
on the server, and hence being the good computer citizen you are, you 
